Diegesis is a GM/campaign narrative engine for tabletop-style roleplay.
A turn runs through a five-stage AI pipeline (router, deck mechanics,
plot planning, NPC agency, scene writing) plus post-turn memory
extraction, under a hard visibility invariant: the scene stage only
ever sees what the player character has witnessed. This repository is
the web version; the engine concept and pipeline are ported from the
nelvinzfx/diegesis Android project by the same author, and remain under
the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
